{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21950","headline":"高仆射 · 白居易","name":"高仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富贵人所爱，圣人去其泰。\n所以致仕年，着在礼经内。\n玄元亦有训，知止则不殆。\n二疏独能行，遗迹东门外。\n清风久销歇，迨此向千载。\n斯人古亦稀，何况今之代。\n遑遑名利客，白首千百辈。\n惟有高仆射，七十悬车盖。\n我年虽未老，岁月亦云迈。\n预恐耄及时，贪荣不能退。\n中心私自儆，何以爲我戒。\n故作仆射诗，书之於大带。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}